# Components

- Place under `atoms/`, `molecules/`, or `organisms/` based on complexity/composition.
- Folder shape: `Name/Name.tsx`, `Name.stories.tsx`, `Name/index.ts`.
- Export from local `index.ts` and from `src/index.ts` for public surface.
- Prefer composing existing primitives over duplicating markup/styles.
- Type props strictly; document key variants in the story.
- Keep accessibility: labelled controls, keyboard reachability, sensible focus.
